  "notes": {
    "s1": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Look v2 — 'Chronicle' direction: graph-paper ground, white tilted cards with big glyphs, bold numbers, round black Add button and round white Map button (no tab bar; Settings via the gear). Logo: the M swoosh in deep green #1E3B2F, which is also the action colour. Inter replaces Nunito + Caveat.\n\nEvery screen is one working prototype (Main); press Play. Map and AR are simulated; photos are illustrated placeholders.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 0
    },
    "s2": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "AR = anchored to real coordinates.\n\nOpen AR → camera turns on → the spot is scanned (feature points + sweep) → position is matched to lat/long → memories left at these coordinates appear as floating glass panels with a ground anchor ring, like spatial windows. Compass strip shows which direction each one is in.\n\n'Plant here' anchors a new memory at the exact coordinates you are standing on.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 1244
    },
    "s3": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Map is its own page (floating 'Map · nearby' button on Home). Tap a pin → a small sheet peeks up with the memory. Drag the sheet up → the full memory detail (photo, story, AR, save, share) unfolds in place; drag it down → it closes and the pin is deselected. Tap the handle to toggle. Bottom nav is Home · + · Settings.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 400
    },
    "t1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 3210,
      "text": "Morrow — Home & browsing",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -260
